394	        <div className="min-w-0 flex-1">
395	          <div className="text-[15px] font-medium text-white">Watch Nightly handle a 3 AM incident</div>
396	          <div className="text-[12.5px] text-white/50">
397	            One click ships a bad release to a live agent. Takes about 2 minutes, with real models.
398	          </div>
